{"articleNo":"1570","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1570&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 겨울 방학중 대구셔틀버스 운행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.13","hit":"12797","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;겨울 방학중 본교에서 개설하는 공개강좌 및 도서관을 이용하는 대구거주 학생들에게 등․하교 교통편의를 제공하여 방학기간내 면학분위기를 조성하기 위하여 대구지역 셔틀버스를 운행하오니 많이 이용하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 운행기간 : 2011. 01. 17(월)～02. 28(월) [운행일수 28일, 토요일, 공휴일 제외]<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 운행회수 : 등교․하교 각 2회 운행&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 운행노선&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 등교<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→시민회관(07:30)→평리네거리(07:40)→</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">학교(08:40)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)→학교(08:40)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 하교<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→평리네거리(19:10)→시민회관(19:20)→범어네거리(19:25)→</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">남부정류장(19:30)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:15)→성서홈플러스(19:10)→광장코아(19:20)→서부정류장(19:30)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 운행차량 : 대구고속관광(주) 45인승 관광전세버스 2대<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 승차대상 : 본교 학생 및 교직원<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 승차장소 :&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">본교 시내버스 승강장(kit 라운지 앞)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011. 1. 13.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&